SUMMARY:Deadline: Kooperativa x Flanders Arts Institute: South-Eastern Euro
 pe Mobility Programme 2026-27
DESCRIPTION:Flanders Arts Institute and the Kooperativa network offer fifte
 en mobility grants for Flanders-based artists and arts professionals in th
 e visual arts\, performing arts\, music and sound to immerse themselves in
  the South-Eastern European arts sector.\n\nOrganisation: Flanders Arts In
 stitute (Kunstenpunt) and Kooperativa\nLocation: Job shadowing at arts org
 anisations in Bosnia and Herzegovina\, Montenegro\, Croatia\, Kosovo\, Nor
 th Macedonia\, Serbia or Slovenia. Open to artists and arts professionals 
 based in Flanders (Belgium) only.\nAward: Fully funded mobility: travel co
 sts\, accommodation and per diems calculated per Erasmus+ formulas\, plus 
 up to EUR 300 for the host organisation's costs. Fifteen grants available.
  No application fee.\nDuration: 3 to 5 days of job shadowing at one organi
 sation\, with mobility actions taking place between 1 October 2026 and 30 
 June 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/kooperativa-x-fai-mobi
 lity-programme-immerse-yourself-in-the-southeastern-european-arts-sector/?
 utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
