SUMMARY:Deadline 13:00 GMT: Screen Ireland Focus Shorts: live-action short 
 film scheme (budgets of up to EUR 70\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 29 Jan 2027 at 13:00 GMT.\n\nFocus Shorts is Screen Irel
 and's scheme for live-action fiction short films of up to 10 minutes\, in 
 English or Irish. WHO: teams of producer\, director and writer\, where the
  producer and director are different people. The producer must have produc
 ed\, and the director directed\, at least one live-action short.\n\nOrgani
 sation: Screen Ireland (Fís Éireann)\nLocation: Republic of Ireland. Tea
 ms must be resident in the Republic of Ireland\; Irish citizens abroad may
  be considered if they return for the production.\nAward: Production budge
 t of up to EUR 70\,000 per film. Writer\, director and producer fees are b
 udgeted at 8 to 10% of the total. No application fee stated.\nDuration: Sh
 ort films of up to 10 minutes\n\nMore: https://www.screenireland.ie/fundin
 g/short-film-schemes/focus-shorts?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&ut
 m_medium=referral
